!apps/sierra-estates-realty/public/downloads/owners-*.csv
!apps/sierra-estates-realty/data/sierra-estates-airtable-import.csv
# snapshot.json must NOT be ignored: the app statically imports it
# (lib/site/data.ts, AvailabilityVerificationService), it is tracked in git as
# a seed stub, and excluding it broke turbo-cached builds whose replayed trace
# lstats the file (ENOENT) even though prebuild would create it on a cold build.
packages/whatsapp-agent/wa_sessions
packages/whatsapp-agent/*.sw_col.json

# Tool artifacts and redundant local clones
.amazonq
.amazonq/**
SE-Vercel-deploy-main*
SE-Vercel-deploy-main*/**
.reports/**
libArchive/**
stubArchive/**
.amphion/**
.claude-flow/**
.factory/**
.qwen/**
.zencoder/**
graphify-out/**
*.tsbuildinfo

# ============================================================================
# 2026-09-29 audit additions (merged on top of the original rules above)
# ============================================================================

# Legacy root public/ (10.9MB design assets) — app serves
# apps/sierra-estates-realty/public; nothing reads the root copy at build.
/public/

